      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are a few high-impact talking points focusing on safety differentiation. Emphasize that CardioZen's rigorous testing shows a superior tolerability profile, framing it not as \"fewer side effects,\" but as \"greater long-term patient comfort.\" You can highlight that our patient data indicates fewer instances of [Specific, less common side effect they have] compared to the competitor. This subtly positions CardioZen as the safer, more patient-centric choice for prescribing physicians.",
